//MCQs

::Spark-RDD::
Which method of RDD can be used to load the data from the filesystem?{
    ~ text()
    ~ textfiles()
    = textFile()
    ~ All of the above
} 

::Spark-RDD::
Which of the following method is used to store the RDD result to the filesystem?{
    ~ save()
    = saveAsTextFile()
    ~ SaveAsTextFile()
    ~ saveastextFile()
}

::Spark-RDD::
Which of the following option returns a tuple consisting of filename and content of the file?{
    ~ whole()
    ~ wholeText()
    ~ wholeTextFile()
    = wholeTextFiles()
}
